bar\"></i></span></a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"字符串 / 大数\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#/e/8\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">53</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">实现 atoi</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">字符串</span><span>LC 8</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"链表\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#algo-gap-435\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">54</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">无重叠区间</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">链表</span><span>LC 435</span><span>解法在本页</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"动态规划\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#/e/221\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">55</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">最大正方形</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">动态规划</span><span>LC 221</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"动态规划\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#/e/64\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">56</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">最小路径和</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">动态规划</span><span>LC 64</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"字符串 / 大数\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#algo-gap-ip-port\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">57</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">IP + 端口转成 uint64</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">字符串</span><span>无题号</span><span>解法在本页</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"二叉树 / 树\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#/e/124\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">58</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">二叉树最大路径和</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">二叉树</span><span>LC 124</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"并发手撕\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#/e/singleton-dcl\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">59</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">单例模式</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">并发手撕</span><span>无题号</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a><a class=\"ab-twin\" href=\"#/e/handwrite-50\">工程手撕</a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"哈希 / 前缀和 / 位运算\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#/e/128\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">60</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">最长连续序列</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">哈希</span><span>LC 128</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"栈 / 队列\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#/e/225\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">61</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">用队列实现栈、用栈实现队列</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">栈</span><span>LC 225</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a><a class=\"ab-twin\" href=\"#/e/lc-face-extra-23\">LC232</a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"回溯\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#/e/17\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">62</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">电话号码的字母组合</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">回溯</span><span>LC 17</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"链表\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#/e/nonlc-4-1\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">63</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">线程安全的 LRU</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">链表</span><span>无题号</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a><a class=\"ab-twin\" href=\"#/e/handwrite-47\">工程手撕</a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"链表\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#/e/148\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">64</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">链表排序（ACM 格式），dummy 节点是否必须，为何用归并</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">链表</span><span>LC 148</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a></li><li class=\"ab-row\" data-type=\"哈希 / 前缀和 / 位运算\" style=\"--w:8%\"><a class=\"ab-hit\" href=\"#/e/lc-face-extra-20\"><span class=\"ab-rank\">65</span><span class=\"ab-main\"><span class=\"ab-title\">长度最小的子数组</span><span class=\"ab-sub\"><span class=\"ab-chip\">哈希</span><span>LC 209</span></span></span><span class=\"ab-freq\"><b>5</b><i class=\"ab-bar\"></i></span></a></li></ol><div class=\"ab-gaps\"><div class=\"ab-gap\" data-type=\"链表\"><section class=\"kb-lecture\" id=\"algo-gap-435\"><h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\">54. 无重叠区间</h3><p class=\"md-p\">LC435。榜单把它归在链表里，题本身是区间贪心：删掉最少的区间，使剩下的互不重叠。端点相接不算重叠。</p><p class=\"md-p\">按结束时间升序。已经保留的区间里，结束最早的那个最容易接上下一个。当前起点不早于上一个结束，就保留，否则丢掉。答案是总数减去保留数。</p><p class=\"md-p\">按起点排序会错：先碰到一个拉得很长的区间，会挡住后面很多短区间。和 LC56 合并区间不是同一问，56 要输出合并后的段，这题只问删几个。</p><div class=\"code-card md-code-card\"><div class=\"code-toolbar\"><span class=\"file-label\">Solution.java</span></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><pre class=\"md-pre\" data-lang=\"java\">int eraseOverlapIntervals(int[][] a) {\n    Arrays.sort(a, (x, y) -&gt; Integer.compare(x[1], y[1]));\n    int keep = 0, end = Integer.MIN_VALUE;\n    for (int[] seg : a) {\n        if (seg[0] &gt;= end) { keep++; end = seg[1]; }\n    }\n    return a.length - keep;\n}</pre></div></div><p class=\"md-p\">排序 O(n log n)，扫描 O(n)。区间端点用 int 比较，不要减出来比较，极端值会溢出。<a href=\"#/e/p-greedy\">贪心与区间专题 →</a></p></section></div><div class=\"ab-gap\" data-type=\"字符串 / 大数\"><section class=\"kb-lecture\" id=\"algo-gap-ip-port\"><h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\">57. IP + 端口转成 uint64</h3><p class=\"md-p\">IPv4 是 4 个 0~255 的字节，端口是 0~65535。放进一个 64 位无符号数时要先说布局：这里把 IP 放在低 32 位之上的 16 位空档之外，也就是 IP 占 [47,16]，端口占 [15,0]，最高 16 位是 0。</p><p class=\"md-p\">每一段先校验再移位。Java 的 int 是有符号的，单字节左移前要转成 long，否则 192&lt;&lt;24 会变成负数，再或端口时高位被符号扩展。</p><div class=\"code-card md-code-card\"><div class=\"code-toolbar\"><span class=\"file-label\">Solution.java</span></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><pre class=\"md-pre\" data-lang=\"java\">long pack(int a, int b, int c, int d, int port) {\n    if ((a | b | c | d) &lt; 0 || a &gt; 255 || b &gt; 255 || c &gt; 255 || d &gt; 255)\n        throw new IllegalArgumentException(&quot;ip&quot;);\n    if (port &lt; 0 || port &gt; 65535) throw new IllegalArgumentException(&quot;port&quot;);\n    long ip = ((long) a &lt;&lt; 24) | ((long) b &lt;&lt; 16) | ((long) c &lt;&lt; 8) | d;\n    return (ip &lt;&lt; 16) | port;\n}</pre></div></div><p class=\"md-p\">拆开是反向移位再掩 0xff / 0xffff。如果面试官要把端口放在高 16 位，先改布局再写，不要默默换。只转 IP、不带端口的写法在 <a href=\"#/e/nonlc-5-4\">IP 转 32 位无符号整数 →</a></p></section></div></div></div>"}]}
